      "hub_id": null,
      "guid": "com.vultify.taskitemindicator",
      "name": "Task Item Indicator",
      "slug": "task-item-indicator",
      "teaser": "A small ring fades in when you're near a task item you still need, and the part facing it lights up so you know which way to turn. Same idea as the indicator live Tarkov added in 1.0.5.0, built from scratch for SPT.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/GQp9VNj2mgiSkhDI83SWYdyQnAukqwmV1WVCehiH.png",
      "downloads": 2122,
      "favourites_count": 17,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Get near a task item you still need and a small ring fades in at the middle of your screen. The part\nof the ring facing the item lights up, so if it’s behind you the bottom lights up and you know to\nturn around. Get on top of it and the whole ring goes bright.</p>\n<p>Live Tarkov added something like this in 1.0.5.0. SPT’s client is older than that patch so it never\nshows up. This isn’t their version ported over, it’s built from scratch to work the same way.</p>\n<p>Only works on task items, the ones that go in your task items tab. A quest that wants three Salewas\nwon’t light up every Salewa on the map.</p>\n<p>Client side only, no server mod. Requires SPT 4.1.2.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install Instructions</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Extract the archive</li>\n<li>Drop the <code>BepInEx</code> folder into your SPT root directory</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Limitations / Bugs</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>With two task items in range it points at the nearest one.</li>\n<li>Not tested with Fika, but should work since its client side only</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Found a bug or have a question? Leave a comment on this mod’s page, or reach out in my thread on the SPT Discord: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/875684761291599922/1521972310595338260\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://discord.com/channels/875684761291599922/1521972310595338260</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
